{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-mama-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"mama-residences","about":"Mama Residences Dubai isn't just a hotel; it's a lifestyle renaissance by Ennismore, a leader in lifestyle hospitality. It's a place to call home within the Mama brand. Designed by Franklin Azzi Architecture and brought to life by French designer Thierry Gaugain, this stunning steel, concrete, and glass tower redefines Dubai's architectural landscape. Gaugain, known as one of the vanguards of contemporary French design, has infused this project with a vision centered around \"life, luxury, and light,\" ushering in a new era of trendsetting energy in Business Bay.Situated just moments away from the iconic Burj Khalifa, Mama Residences offers more than just a place to stay; it's a lifestyle experience. These eclectic residential apartments, including studios and 1-2 bedroom Residences, represent a Paris-born design concept elevated to new heights in the heart of Dubai's skyline. With luxurious and avant-garde design elements, these homes are a fusion of modernism's bold aesthetics and the vibrant styling characteristic of the world's most forward-thinking designers. Within a building that's a work of art itself, Mama Residences transforms the city's skyline with its bold and visionary architecture.","price":1200000,"title":"MAMA Residences","bitrix":{"id":308,"pf_id":"are.2.12653","source":null,"project_id":"Mama Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"MAMA Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Khamas Group","project_location":"Business Bay"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/mama_feature_c07d4bab04.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/mama_feature_c07d4bab04.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.180438,"lng":55.2693091},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3